      "title": {
        "en": "Zero to five"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Zero, jeden, dwa, trzy, cztery, pięć*. *Cz* in *cztery* is like English ch in church, and *rz* in *trzy* is like sh after the t. *Plus* and *minus* are as in English, and *to* or *jest* gives the answer: *dwa plus trzy to pięć*."
      }
    }
